  "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETo check your general health\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETo find anaemia, infections or some blood disorders\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ETo monitor some conditions and treatments\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E"
